      "answerId": "cie-9702-9702_s25_qp_23:q1:answer",
      "answer": null,
      "answerKey": null,
      "markPoints": [
        "Rate of change of displacement",
        "s = ut + ½at²",
        "t = √(2×10 / 9.81) = 1.4",
        "h = −(3 × 1.4) + (0.5 × 9.81 × 1.4²) = 5.7 m / OR h = −(3 × 1.4) + 10 = 5.7 m",
        "time taken (to reach the ground is) same",
        "The initial vertical (component of the) velocity is the same (as in part (1b))",
        "The (total) initial energy is greater (than in part (1b))",
        "change in gravitational potential energy is same, so speed is greater"
      ],
